      "explanation": "When Zn react with hot conc. H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> then SO<sub>2</sub> is released and ZnSO<sub>4</sub> is obtained.<br><br> <picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-320w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-500w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-680w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 860px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-860w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1040px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-1040w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1220px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-1220w.jpeg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 1400px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h-1400w.jpeg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7tcl3g/7573fa86-be26-4f6c-a0cb-b3ae6fd575ac/5d9a40c0-0e9c-11ec-87ef-035aec66293c/file-1kt7tcl3h.jpeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2019 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - p-Block Elements Question 61 English Explanation 1\"></picture> <br><br>R(SO<sub>2</sub>) molecule is V-shaped<br><br> <img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kt7td81t/b7b85f02-750e-42b3-b7b8-e21b012fc9f6/6f559710-0e9